# Monorepo Guidelines

- Architecture: npm workspaces with `packages/ui` (`@smart-pantry/ui`) and `packages/web`.
- Stack: Next.js App Router (`web`), React (`ui`), TypeScript strict, Tailwind CSS, Zustand (`web`), Jest + RTL.
- Never use `any`. Define explicit interfaces and types.
- All code, comments, commit messages, and documentation must be in **English**.
- Keep components decoupled and accessible. The `web` app consumes UI from `@smart-pantry/ui`.
